					"content": "说得也对…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000320
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105000320,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，不是说好「师徒」只是演戏而已吗！",
