					"content": "这是尊严，也是心境的问题，占星术士如果认为占星术能解决一切，就会被星空放弃。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000209,
					"content": "占卜会失去指引的能力，再也看不透前方的迷雾，所以，原则就是原则。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000210,
					"content": "有这么厉害的能力居然不用来赚钱，太可惜了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000211,
					"content": "唉，本来说如果你们愿意，我可以出两万摩拉作酬谢的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朱老板"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000213,
					"content": "你怎么了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000215
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105000214,
					"content": "你的表情有点奇怪。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000215
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105000212,
					"content": "两万…！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000213,
						105000214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000216,
					"content": "你刚刚才说了占星术士的尊严。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000218
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105000217,
					"content": "你刚刚才说了原则就是原则。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000218
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105000215,
					"content": "没、没有啊？只是，觉得…能捡到戒指的人，运气真好啊，这样就能赚两万摩拉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000216,
						105000217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000218,
					"content": "咳咳，是这样没错，不过呢…老板做生意这么辛苦，愿意花大钱去找这个戒指，它一定意义非凡吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000219,
					"content": "就这么走了也不太好，我们努力找一下吧。就算不用占星术，或许也有另外的办法。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000220,
					"content": "她和我想到一起去了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000222,
					"content": "真没办法…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000224
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105000223,
					"content": "又变成我的事了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000224
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105000221,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，这件事就交给你吧！这是师父交给你的第一个任务！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000222,
						105000223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000224,
					"content": "嗯…既然是被史莱姆吞了，那可以用「元素诱饵」把附近的史莱姆全都引过来吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000825,
					"content": "你知道吗？晨曦酒庄在酿酒的时候，意外提炼出一种东西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000826
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000826,
					"content": "虽然配方保密，但对史莱姆有很强的吸引效果。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000827
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000227,
					"content": "不愧是你！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000228
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105000229,
					"content": "该不会是想嘴馋的时候…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000230
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105000226,
					"content": "其实…嘿嘿，我悄悄带了一点在身上！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000227,
						105000229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000228,
					"content": "作为搭档，我很可靠吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000230,
					"content": "哎呀，细节就不用在意啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000231,
					"content": "看起来，你们有好办法了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000232
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000232,
					"content": "嗯，我们去去就来！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
